flowchart LR
    arm[Azure CLI<br/>control plane] --> account[StorageV2 account]
    account --> share[Bounded SMB file share]
    memory[Account key<br/>memory only] -->|bootstrap sample| share
    share --> snapshot[Share snapshot<br/>after content]
    soft[Seven-day soft delete] -->|delete and restore| share
    principal[Approved Entra principal] -->|Kerberos ticket| smb[Azure Files SMB endpoint]
    smb --> share
    role[SMB Share Contributor<br/>exact share scope] -->|authorizes principal| share
    gates[Tenant consent, CA,<br/>client and ACL gates] --> smb
    classDef control fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#102a43;
    classDef resource fill:#e9f8ef,stroke:#16803a,color:#102a43;
    class arm,memory,principal,role,gates control;
    class account,share,snapshot,soft,smb resource;
